{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309180","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1130918001:1":{"text":"ハァ……ボスが依頼を受けたのよ。これが、この世界のルール。どんなに不本意でも、依頼を受けたらやるしかない。","source_cn":"哈！谁让我们老大接了委托呢。这世道就是这样，不管有多不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFAD422170A936C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130918002:1":{"text":"そのババリアの女は金払いがいいらしく、ボスは多くの分け前を与えると約束してくれた。そうじゃなかったら、とっくに辞めてるわよ。","source_cn":"要不是那个蛮血女孩给的报酬特别丰厚，老大还答应多给我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F468DF37913EAB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130918003:1":{"text":"とはいえ、報酬がいいといっても、残陽神の財宝とは比べものにならないと思わない？私たちはバウンティハンターなのよ！","source_cn":"话又说回来了，报酬再丰厚又怎么样，能和残阳神的宝藏比吗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE4D3F0E57C3D68C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130918004:1":{"text":"もう、どうしていいかわからない！いっそ投げ出してしまって一人で……","source_cn":"真纠结！我要不要出去单干呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE20AD2EE71F40D5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:赏金猎人索普莉":{"text":"ハンターのソプリー","source":"赏金猎人索普莉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}